{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45164","headline":"奉酬袁使君西楼饯秦山人与昼同赴李侍御招三韵 · 皎然","name":"奉酬袁使君西楼饯秦山人与昼同赴李侍御招三韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋风怨别情，江守上西城。\n竹暑寒流浅，琴窗宿雨晴。\n治书招远意，知共楚狂行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}